OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSASuspected fly tippers shamed with
OL,4,Aonline photos
OL,5,
OL,6,FA west London council that says it has
OL,7,F"had enough" of fly tipping has begun
OL,8,Fsharing CCTV images on social media,
OL,9,Fshowing people allegedly being caught
OL,10,Fin the act of dumping rubbish in public
OL,11,Fplaces.
OL,13,FHillingdon Council described the crime
OL,14,Fas a "blight" on the borough, and as a
OL,15,Flocal authority, it had "allowed the
OL,16,Fproblem to get bigger".
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
