OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSASuspected fly tippers shamed with
OL,4,Aonline photos
OL,5,
OL,6,FCabinet member for community
OL,7,Fenvironment and enforcement, Adam
OL,8,FBennett, said the action was a "really
OL,9,Fgood first step" adding: "We really
OL,10,Fneed to up our game on all forms of of
OL,11,Fenforcement."
OL,13,FHe said since its CCTV images were
OL,14,Fshared earlier this week they had over
OL,15,F850,000 views, received 2,500 comments
OL,16,Fincluding information on who the
OL,17,Fperpetrators might be.
